 "resumo_pt": "The Tubes é uma banda de rock originalmente de São Francisco, Califórnia. As músicas \"White Punks on Dope\" e \"She's a Beauty\" são as mais conhecidas do grupo.",
 "resumo_en": "The Tubes are a San Francisco-based rock band. Their self-titled 1975 debut album included the single \"White Punks on Dope\", while their 1983 single \"She's a Beauty\" was a top-10 U.S. hit and its music video was frequently played in the early days of MTV. The band also performed in the 1980 film Xanadu, singing the rock portion of the cross-genre song \"Dancin'\" opposite a big band.",
