   "resumo_en": "The Completion Backward Principle is the fifth studio album by the American rock band the Tubes. It is the group's first for Capitol Records. It was accompanied by a long-form music video release of the same name, although it did not contain all of the songs from the album. It is a concept album presented as a motivational business document.  The album contains two hit singles, \"Don't Want to Wait Anymore\" and \"Talk to Ya Later.\"",
